  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2205.03 Background Investigation Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2205.03 Background Investigation Fee. In addition to any other fees required by statute or rule, pursuant to RSA 106-F:8, III, an applicant shall pay a fee of $10.00 for expenses of the investigation conducted by the division.\n\nSource. #9484 eff 6-19-09 (from Saf-C 2205.02); ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18",
